{2}╭─────────────────────────────────────────────╮{R}
{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Pause an otter managed running container{R}   {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter pz    [options] [container]{R}          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter pause [options] [container]{R}          {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter pz my-box{R}                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter pz --all{R}                            {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter pause ubuntu,fedora{R}                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter pause --all --root{R}                   {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     {2}┆{R} {4}-a{R}  {5}Pause all running otters{R}    {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-r{R}  {5}Pause rootful containers{R}    {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────┴─────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                    {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}      {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────┴─────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Paused containers are frozen in memory. Use{R} {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}'otter start' to resume a paused container.{R} {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ See also:{R}                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Rootful containers need '--root' to work.{R}{2}   │{R}
{2}╰─────────────────────────────────────────────╯{R}
